  "title": "TD Asset Management Inc. Announces Changes to the Sales Charge Options",
  "summary": "Effective on or about September 11, 2026 (the \"Effective Date\"), TDAM will convert all deferred sales charge options (including DSC, LSC and LSC2) of the Advisor Series, T5 series, and T8 Series of applicable Funds to the initial sales charge (ISC) purchase option of the same series of the Funds.",
